        "person": "lewy",
        "club": "pol"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Real world first. September 2008: Lewandowski scores on his Poland debut.",
      "say": "Real world first. September, two thousand eight: Lehvandoffskee scores on his Poland debut.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "news",
        "section": "Poland",
        "headline": "Lewandowski scores on his Poland debut",
        "standfirst": "The Lech Poznań striker plays his first game for Poland, and scores, in San Marino.",
