        "byline": "Knowitball recap",
        "club": "pol",
        "person": "lewy",
        "nav": [
          "Football",
          "Poland",
          "Internationals"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He became Poland's most capped player, and their record scorer, with eighty-nine goals.",
