          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "And this March, a World Cup play-off final in Sweden. Gyökeres wins it in the eighty-eighth minute.",
      "say": "And this March, a World Cup play-off final in Sweden. Yurkeresh wins it in the eighty-eighth minute.",
