        "as": 2,
        "date": "31 March 2026 · Solna",
        "comp": "World Cup play-off final",
        "note": "Gyökeres 88' · Poland miss the World Cup"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Trophies with Poland: none.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stamp",
        "text": "0 TROPHIES",
        "sub": "Poland · 2008 to 2026",
        "person": "lewy",
        "color": "red"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Now the alternate world. Same years, but Lewandowski wears the blue of Italy.",
